Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(plugins): assign the host api ref after commit, not
 during render

Assigning a ref while rendering breaks React's purity rule: a render that is
thrown away would still have published its api object through getHost(). The
effect mirrors how the context ref in this file is already updated.
